Environment: Windows amd64; Go 1.27.3; AMD Ryzen 7 9700X.
Working directory: backend
GOEXPERIMENT=greenteagc,jsonv2 GOMAXPROCS=4; package build concurrency -p 2.

forwarding-unit.log (also includes XLSX tests):
GOEXPERIMENT=greenteagc,jsonv2 GOMAXPROCS=4 go test -p 2 -tags unit ./internal/service -run 'Test(AnthropicBuffered|WSComparable|AnthropicSSEDelta|AppendRawJSON|ShouldKeepIngress|NormalizeOpenAIWSPayload|HandleResponsesBufferedStreamingResponse|HandleCCBufferedFromAnthropic|Claude55ResponsesSignedThinking|AnthropicNative|GatewayService_Streaming|HandleStreamingResponse|UsageExport)' -count=1

